        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.8.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 8:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka witieko tundo i lowo ma Rwoth Were mewin miyo win to wilunjo to wibed'iye, to wiwaco ni, “Walayero kere dhumo wan, paka nonin ma jothoko wan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Winyalo adieri yero kere ma Rwoth Were mewin layero. Dhano m'obedo acel kwoŋ win, to wikiripi yero japath ma kiwoki i dier win, dhumo win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kerin 10:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kigana 1:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.9.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kere kiripi bedo gi kayinin kweth, kosa dwoko ji i Misir ŋey wolimi kayinin man, paka Rwoth otieko waco riwin, wikiripi gik koro kendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.1+1KI.11.2+1KI.11.3+1KI.11.4+1KI.11.5+1KI.11.6+1KI.11.7+1KI.11.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kerin 11:1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.14+1KI.10.15+1KI.10.16+1KI.10.17+1KI.10.18+1KI.10.19+1KI.10.20+1KI.10.21+1KI.10.22"
              },
              "items": [
